  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Tonight I Want 2 Celebrate With You**: earliest performance in the archive; mythic rare: 2 archived performances [5]\n- **Dancefloors**: with Boston Horns [5]\n- **Easy Mornin Rebel**: with Horns [5]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **mmj2006-12-02.4022.flac16** (recommended): source not stated; 20 songs; 116 min; rated 5/5 by 2 [1]. Said about its sound: Avalon acoustics were excellent, though the recording captured too many side conversations from the crowd [4]\n- **mmj2006-12-02**: source not stated; 21 songs; 115 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Guests: Boston Horns, Horns [1]\n- Boston audience displayed serial soul constipation, remaining cramped and unresponsive to the band's performance [3]\n- Reviewer stood three rows back, feeling the music surround and consume them intensely [4]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **mmj2006-12-02.4022.flac16**: taped by Matt Falise; source: DPA 4022(ORTF)>AERCO MP2>Maratz PMD-671 (24/48) [1]\n- **mmj2006-12-02**: taped by John Lynch; transferred by Alex Leary; source: Neumann AK40 > LC3 > KM100 > Oade 148 > V3 > DA-P1 [2]. Also: Transferred via Tascam DA-20 and Edirol R-44, then processed by Alex Leary [2]",
